Hyakki distribution notice

Hyakki is Ryoku's native AI harness, distributed from ryoku/hyakki/.
The public executables are hyakki, oni, hyakki-app and oni-surface. The Go module name
ryoku-rashin and published protocol and cryptographic identifiers remain
unchanged. The retained source notices may therefore still say Rashin.

